OL,3,GNEWSAFlood victim, 95, lived in
OL,4,AWetherspoons after her home was
OL,5,Adestroyed and died before she could
OL,6,Areturn
OL,7,
OL,8,FWhen neighbours hammered on Jean
OL,9,FPowell's door and evacuated her to
OL,10,Fsafety because the nearby river had
OL,11,Fburst its banks and swamped her town,
OL,12,Flittle did she know she would never
OL,13,Freturn home.
OL,15,FJean sought a 10-month refuge at her
OL,16,Flocal Wetherspoons but kept asking when
OL,17,Fshe could go back to her flat, which
OL,18,Fwas flooded when the River Monnow hit
OL,19,F18-times its normal level in south
OL,20,FWales in November 2025.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
