OL,3,GNEWSAFlood victim, 95, lived in
OL,4,AWetherspoons after her home was
OL,5,Adestroyed and died before she could
OL,6,Areturn
OL,7,
OL,8,FBut the 95-year-old never got to go
OL,9,Fback home and died in September - one
OL,10,Fof those who suffered a personal toll
OL,11,Ffrom the effects of being flooded.
OL,13,F"Jean used to say, when am I going
OL,14,Fhome?" said friend and neighbour Wyn
OL,15,FSmith. "All she wanted to do was come
OL,16,Fback home and we couldn't fulfil that."
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
